為劉璋心腹。在龐氏嫁予劉循后，龐氏家族成為劉璋政權的核心支柱之一。劉璋投降劉備后，劉循被任命為奉車中郎將，龐氏隨其留居蜀地。","en":"Wife of Liu Xun, eldest son of Governor of Yi Province Liu Zhang, and daughter of Pang Xi, Governor of Baxi. A native of Langzhong in Baxi Commandery, her father Pang Xi was Liu Zhang's trusted confidant. After Lady Pang married Liu Xun, the Pang family became one of the core pillars of Liu Zhang's regime. After Liu Zhang surrendered to Liu Bei, Liu Xun was appointed General of the Household for Imperial Chariots, and Lady Pang remained with him in Shu.","jp":"益州牧・劉璋の長男である劉循の妻であり、巴西太守・龐羲の娘。巴西郡閬中の出身。父の龐羲は劉璋の腹心であった。龐氏が劉循に嫁いだ後、龐氏の家族は劉璋政権の核心的支柱の一つとなった。劉璋が劉備に降伏した後、劉循は奉車中郎将に任じられ、龐氏もそれに従って蜀の地に留まった。","kr":"익주목 유장의 장남 유순의 아내이자 파서태수 방희의 딸입니다. 파서군 낭중 출신으로, 부친 방희는 유장의 심복이었습니다. 방씨가 유순에게 시집간 뒤 방씨 가문은 유장 정권의 핵심 지주 중 하나가 되었습니다. 유장이 유비에게 항복한 후 유순이 봉거중랑장에 임명되자, 방씨 역시 남편을 따라 촉 땅에 머물렀습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1041315","remark":"","surname":"庞","surnameTc":"龐","surnameEn":"Pang","surnameJp":"龐","surnameKr":"방","surnameOther":"","name":"洛","nameTc":"洛","nameEn":"Luo","nameJp":"洛","nameKr":"낙","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"庞洛","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"210","city":"CS1001","gender":"1","rule":"42","force":"25","wise":"60","politics":"67","charm":"76","will":"56","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"11/10/25/12/13/14/13/10","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"1800","battleSoulPoint":"600","debateSoulPoint":"3600","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/1/0/0/0/1/1/2/2/0/1/1/1/1/0/1/2/1/0/1/0